                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The pech's last action was to knock a creature @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Prone]</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The pech flexes menacingly, attempting to [[/act demoralize]] a target other than the required creature. This Demoralize attempt has the visual trait instead of the auditory trait and doesn't take a penalty if the target doesn't share a language with the pech. On a success, the target also becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] to the pech until the start of the pech's next turn.</p>"
